    {
      "platform": "windows",
      "version": "3.10.0",
      "release_date": "2026-08-31",
      "release_notes": "- Minimum required Java is now 21, due to updated SWT\n- Bundle Java 25 with Windows and Mac builds\n- Virtual Threads are now used by default without the maximum upper limit\n- Default display mode is now Alive Only, so dead hosts are not shown\n- MacOS build should not require Rosetta anymore\n- Added Japanese translations\n- Update all translations with newer keys\n- Fixed some rare crashes if no network connectivity\n- Fixed possible SQL injection when executing files generated by SQLExporter\n- Make getting started dialog resizable\n- Security: plugin trust confirmation dialog - new plugins require user approval before loading\n- Security: shell arguments are now quoted when passed to openers to prevent command injection via DNS poisoning\n- Better escaping in XMLExporter & CSVExporter\n- Many minor stability fixes\n- Updated MAC vendors",
      "release_notes_url": "https://github.com/angryip/ipscan/releases/tag/3.10.0",
      "manifest_version": "1.12.0",
      "manifest_dir": "manifests/a/angryziber/AngryIPScanner/3.10.0",
